      "content": "It is incredibly painful to feel like you are in an unending struggle where the world itself seems against you. That profound sense of exhaustion and questioning existence is a heavy burden to carry alone. Please consider that even if the external world feels unchanging, there are ways to change how you interact with that reality, and talking to a professional can help you find a different kind of finish line.",
      "source": "target",
